1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:06,500
Welcome to Apex Drive VR: next-generation high-speed combat racing built natively for Meta Quest.

2
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:19,500
Engage dual plasma nitro thrusters to break the 280 km/h speed barrier with real chassis dynamics.

3
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:39,500
Featuring 6DOF interactive steering, real-time diegetic telemetry, and spatial acoustics designed for seated VR comfort.

4
00:00:52,500 --> 00:01:00,000
Battle multiple unique AI racing personalities that dynamically clip inside apexes and defend lane position.

5
00:01:13,500 --> 00:01:21,500
Watch your mirrors: high-speed police interceptors actively contest your line with tactical lane blocking and PIT maneuvers.

6
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:57,500
Push your electric supercar to the absolute limit across a full five-lap urban championship circuit.

7
00:02:19,500 --> 00:02:27,000
Cross the checkered flag as first-place champion, fully engineered for Meta Quest platform excellence.

8
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:36,500
Apex Drive VR: download now on the Meta Quest release channel and explore the open-source repository on GitHub.